# But do consumers really care about motors?

This is the most important issue in the entire article.

The tech community likes to talk about parameters, but consumers vote with their feet. We need to ask honestly:** From 100,000 to 160,000, users can sense the suction; from 160,000 to 200,000, do differences still feel?**

The answer is:** marginal utility is significantly reduced**.

